<title>FRANCE: S&amp;P-Adef confirms T1 rating on SEB paper.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P-Adef confirms T1 rating on SEB paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>S&amp;P-Adef said on Thursday it confirmed its T1 rating on a two billion franc issue of bills by appliance maker SEB SA.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the T1 rating, signifying short-term investment-grade quality, reflects SEB's strong competitive position on the small appliance market, its capacity for innovation and prudent financial strategy since 1989. The short-term ratings range from T1 to T4.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
